================================================================================
A note on licence identification
================================================================================

At the time this repository was created, none of the upstream projects listed
above shipped a LICENSE file. Each declared its licence only through the
`license` field of its `package.json`:

    dstu7564          BSD-2-Clause
    jkurwa            BSD
    dstucrypt-algos   BSD
    gost89            BSD
    dstu7624          BSD
    jksreader         BSD

"BSD" on its own is not an SPDX identifier and does not distinguish between the
2-clause, 3-clause and 4-clause variants. We have therefore treated these
components as permissively licensed in line with their authors' evident intent,
retained their copyright notices, and recorded the ambiguity here rather than
resolving it silently in either direction.

If you are an author of any of the above and wish this notice corrected — or the
licence stated precisely — please open an issue. We will amend it promptly.
